Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Agent red state mein ho toh paanch common problems check kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.08,0:00:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pehla — Tally band hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Tally kholiye aur company load karo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.85,0:00:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Doosra — network issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.32,0:00:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Internet check kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Teesra — ODBC not enabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.38,0:00:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Tally F1 Configure mein ODBC enable karna zaroori hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.83,0:00:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Chautha — password mismatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.61,0:00:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Agar Tally password badla hai, agent mein bhi update kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Paanchwa — company path badal gaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.68,0:00:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Agent settings mein new path daaliye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.04,0:00:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In paanch mein se koi ek fix karne se 90 percent problems solve ho jaate hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.02,0:00:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nahi ho, toh WhatsApp par FLOWRA support ko error screenshot bhejo — team help karegi.
